			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1505,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(UIQP): wire reply channel for ShowQuickPick/ShowInputBox/ShowOpenDialog/ShowSaveDialog\n\nAll four dialog methods previously emitted the Sky event and returned\nOk(null) immediately (fire-and-forget), so the extension host never\nreceived the user's selection — every quick-pick and input-box resolved\nwith undefined on the Cocoon side.\n\nNow each handler:\n  1. Creates a tokio::sync::oneshot channel.\n  2. Registers the (nonce → tx) pair via ApplicationState.UI.AddPendingRequest.\n  3. Emits the Sky event with the nonce included in the payload.\n  4. Awaits rx, mapping the CommonError variant and the RecvError (sender\n     dropped / dialog cancelled) to String so the MappedEffect type is\n     satisfied.\n\nThe frontend calls the existing `ResolveUIRequest` Tauri command with the\nnonce and the selected value; that removes the sender from the map and\ncompletes the await here, returning the selection as Ok(Value) to the\nextension host.",
			"SHA": "ad64c889c5c803a7f398123c93000e704240bd7d"
		},
